ar]]\n* 100 g fine [[Cookbook:Oatmeal|oatmeal]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoons]] [[Cookbook:Baking Soda|baking soda]]\n* 2 bags of [[Cookbook:Vanilla Sugar|vanilla sugar]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Finely [[Cookbook:Dice|dice]] the marzipan or mash it with a fork. [[Cookbook:Beating|Beat]] it well with butter, milk, and eggs.\n# Mix the remaining dry ingredients. Add them to the butter and egg mixture, and mix to make a smooth [[Cookbook:Batter|batter]]. If it is too dry, add a little more milk.\n# Place [[Cookbook:Muffin Pan|muffin tins]] on a [[Cookbook:Baking Sheet|baking sheet]]. Spread the batter in the tins and [[Cookbook:Baking|bake]] at 180°C for 20–25 minutes.\n# If desired, decorate the muffins with chocolate icing and sprinkles.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for muffins]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using marzipan]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking soda]]\n[[Category:Recipes using white sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cow milk]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Marzipan Muffins","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"150 g marzipan","sourceText":"150 g marzipan","amountText":"150 g marzipan","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"150 g butter","sourceText":"150 g butter","amountText":"150 g butter","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"3 eggs","sourceText":"3 eggs","amountText":"3 eggs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"100 ml milk","sourceText":"100 ml milk","amountText":"100 ml milk","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"100 g flour","sourceText":"100 g flour","amountText":"100 g flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"100 g white granulated sugar","sourceText":"100 g white granulated sugar","amountText":"1